# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If we apply DD using `XY4` to the same circuit as before, do you expect it to yield results that are much better, much worse, or about the same, as DD using `XX`? Explain.\n"
msgstr "Dacă aplicăm DD folosind `XY4` la același circuit ca înainte, te aștepți ca acesta să producă rezultate mult mai bune, mult mai proaste, sau aproximativ la fel, ca DD folosind `XX`? Explică.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
